---
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
---

<section class="section" id="why">
	<div class="shell">
		<SectionHead label="Why this exists" />

		<div class="grid">
			{/* A statement, not a heading — "Why this exists" above is the heading. */}
			<p class="head rise">
				Everyone is guessing.<br />Come guess <em>out loud</em>.
			</p>

			<div class="body rise" style="--rise-delay: 120ms">
				<p>
					The field moves faster than anyone can read. Papers land weekly, tools
					break monthly, and most of what actually works is folklore &mdash;
					passed between people who already tried it and watched it fail.
				</p>
				<p>
					So we meet. Someone shows the agent they got working. Someone else
					shows the one they didn&rsquo;t. You ask the question you were too
					embarrassed to post. Nobody checks your credentials at the door,
					because there is no credential for this yet.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.section {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		background: var(--color-ink);
		padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 12vw, 9rem);
	}

	.grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
		align-items: start;
	}

	/* Emphasis by misregistration: two plates a hair out of alignment, the way
	   a press drifts. Same idea as the wordmark, held much quieter. */
	.head em {
		font-style: normal;
		color: var(--color-paper);
		text-shadow:
			0.042em -0.026em 0 var(--color-cyan),
			-0.036em 0.026em 0 var(--color-magenta);
	}

	.body {
		max-width: 46ch;
		padding-top: 0.5rem;
	}

	.body p {
		margin: 0 0 1.15em;
		color: var(--color-paper-2);
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
		line-height: 1.68;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.body p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 880px) {
		.grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
